 narrate the history of the monetary dispute, while the next two and a half deal with the right claimed by Chaeremon to take his daughter away from her husband against her will. The last column and a half revert to the monetary dispute."},{"label":"Catalogue Identifier","value":"Papyrological Reference: P. Oxy. II 237"}],"startCanvas":"https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/canvas/e405ba09-fe05-4cae-817e-92a66be7b604.json"},{"@id":"https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/range/74cc30b3-48b9-4cf0-b2fa-b790d222ab03/LOG_0002","@type":"sc:Range","label":"MS. Gr. class. a. 8 (P)/1","canvases":["https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/canvas/e405ba09-fe05-4cae-817e-92a66be7b604.json","https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/canvas/8f2e5817-0ef5-4a02-9e65-821d3a21b33a.json","https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/canvas/e7737878-0e2f-41cf-bd27-598090a25354.json","https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/canvas/ef563e59-6bd5-4026-ae89-2e343e19ebd1.json","https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/canvas/643ca6be-aec5-488d-90b7-1d916dee3f71.json","https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/canvas/739ddcd1-5c17-4a03-aea1-3c4d07831e96.json"],"metadata":[{"label":"Image Range","value":"section 1 recto\u2013section 6 recto"}],"startCanvas":"https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/canvas/e405ba09-fe05-4cae-817e-92a66be7b604.json"},{"@id":"https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/range/74cc30b3-48b9-4cf0-b2fa-b790d222ab03/LOG_0003","@type":"sc:Range","label":"MS. Gr. class. a. 8 (P)/2 (a)","canvases":["https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/canvas/8f58337e-523e-41fb-8b41-ae8b62ab2d89.json"],"metadata":[{"label":"Image Range","value":"recto"}],"startCanvas":"https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/canvas/8f58337e-523e-41fb-8b41-ae8b62ab2d89.json"},{"@id":"https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/range/74cc30b3-48b9-4cf0-b2fa-b790d222ab03/LOG_0004","@type":"sc:Range","label":"MS. Gr. class. a. 8 (P)/2 (b)","canvases":["https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/canvas/d633882d-bc43-4c7f-a327-3e89593969a9.json"],"metadata":[{"label":"Image Range",